  "title": "LinkedIn Power Creators (Part 1)",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "company": "LinkedIn",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "The LinkedIn Creator team is seeking individuals with a strong influence on the platform, using their personal profiles as a company or influencer page. To identify such power creators, compare the number of followers on a person's LinkedIn page with the number of followers of the company they work for. If the person's page has more followers than their company, they are a power creator.\n\nWrite a query to retrieve the profile IDs of these LinkedIn power creators, in ascending order of profile ID.",
